            },
            {
              "kind": "insert_after",
              "paragraphId": "p0088",
              "text": "Sparkling is and shall remain the owner of all intellectual property rights in the Modifications and any other work product developed specifically for Sparkling and paid for by Sparkling under this Agreement (collectively, the \"Sparkling Deliverables\"), and Garman hereby assigns to Sparkling all right, title and interest in the Sparkling Deliverables. To the extent any intellectual property of Garman existing independently of this Agreement is embedded in the Sparkling Deliverables, Garman grants Sparkling a perpetual, irrevocable, worldwide, royalty-free licence to use, modify and sublicense such intellectual property as part of the Sparkling Deliverables. Sparkling retains all right, title and interest in Sparkling's data, including data converted pursuant to Section 4, and Garman acquires no rights in such data. No intellectual property is jointly owned under this Agreement."
